  "description": "The Daily Grinder 3 is made for everyone who is on the go every day – and expects more than just functionality. It combines the dynamism of a gravel bike with the everyday practicality of a commuter bike. The sporty geometry ensures efficient propulsion, while mudguards, lights and a luggage rack provide everything you need for everyday use. With precise Shimano GRX 12-speed shifting, hydraulic brakes for optimal deceleration in all weather conditions and wide Schwalbe G-One tyres, the Daily Grinder is ready for any route – whether to work, to the café or out into nature after work on changing terrain.",
